<title>ESTONIA: Estonia Feb mo/mo CPI up 0.9 pct, yr/yr 9.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Estonia Feb mo/mo CPI up 0.9 pct, yr/yr 9.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian consumer prices rose by a monthly 0.9 percent in February for a year-on-year inflation rate of 9.9 percent, the country's statistics department said on Friday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN CPI			Feb 97    Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (PCT)    +0.9	+1.4	 +3.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (PCT)	+9.9	+12.6	+29.4</p>
<p> Index (1993 average =100)    +248.4	246.1	225.9</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
